     "body": "<p>Should be able to change:<br/>\n&lt;dependency&gt;<br/>\n      &lt;groupId&gt;postgresql&lt;/groupId&gt;<br/>\n      &lt;artifactId&gt;postgresql&lt;/artifactId&gt;<br/>\n      &lt;version&gt;9.1-902.jdbc4&lt;/version&gt;<br/>\n      &lt;scope&gt;runtime&lt;/scope&gt;<br/>\n &lt;/dependency&gt;</p>\n\n<p>to:<br/>\n&lt;dependency&gt;<br/>\n      &lt;groupId&gt;org.postgresql&lt;/groupId&gt;<br/>\n      &lt;artifactId&gt;postgresql&lt;/artifactId&gt;<br/>\n      &lt;version&gt;9.3-1102-jdbc41&lt;/version&gt;<br/>\n      &lt;scope&gt;runtime&lt;/scope&gt;<br/>\n &lt;/dependency&gt;</p>",
     "created": "14/Aug/14 4:40 PM",
